flowchart LR
  User --> Onboarding[Optional medicine name and daily times]
  Onboarding --> LocalDB[(SQLite local-only reminders)]
  LocalDB --> M09[M09 daily notification coordinator]
  M09 --> OS[Generic daily OS notification]
  OS --> Settings[Notification Settings management]
  Settings --> LocalDB
  Merge[User confirms Guest merge] --> ReKey[Re-key local owner only]
  ReKey --> LocalDB
  LocalDB -. excluded .-> Cloud[Cloud snapshot / SyncOutbox]

